&lt;p&gt;Biodiversity Net Gain Plan and Habitat Management Monitoring Plan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;a&quot;&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;No development shall commence until a Biodiversity Gain
     Plan and a Habitat Management &amp;amp; Monitoring Plan (HMMP) have been
     submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The
     plans shall be prepared in accordance with the requirements (or subsequent
     updates) of the Environment Act 2021 and the DEFRA and Planning Practice
     Guidance on Biodiversity Net Gain. The Biodiversity Gain Plan and HMMP
     should include, but shall not be limited to:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;i&quot;&gt;
  &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Completed Statutory Biodiversity Metric tool;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Pre-development and post-development plans;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;A compensation plan for irreplaceable habitat (if
      required);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Aims &amp;amp; objectives;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Schedule of works (to include date of first planting);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Management actions; and,&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Monitoring actions.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:72.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;Where part of the Biodiversity
Gain Plan is dependent on the purchase of off-site Biodiversity Units through a
habitat bank, written justification must be provided as to why the required
on-site or off-site biodiversity gain cannot be achieved. The BNG register
reference number, proof of purchase and, details of the land manager and/or
landowner, must be included within the Biodiversity Gain Plan.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;Where part of the Biodiversity
Gain Plan is dependent on the purchase of statutory biodiversity credits,
written justification must be provided as to why it is not possible to purchase
off-site Biodiversity Units through a habitat bank. Proof of purchase of the
credits must be provided as part of the Biodiversity Gain Plan.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;The approved HMMP shall be
strictly adhered to and implemented in full for its duration.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;The approved plan shall make
clear how requirements for biodiversity are addressed in relation to land based
and watercourse units.&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;2&quot; type=&quot;a&quot;&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;A monitoring report shall be submitted to and approved
     in writing by the Local Planning Authority at year 5 following first
     planting (as required by part a(v) of this condition) of the development
     hereby approved. The monitoring report shall confirm full compliance with
     the approved Biodiversity Gain Plan and HMMP.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;





















&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
